<span class="line" data-line="4"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)"># Vercel AI SDK and Anthropic model for AI generation and tool-calling</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">npm</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> install</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> ai</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> @ai-sdk/anthropic</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> zod</span></span>
