<span class="line" data-line="4"></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)"># Anthropic</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">ANTHROPIC_API_KEY</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">&quot;your-anthropic-key&quot;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="7"></span>
<span class="line" data-line="8"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)"># Database Connections</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="9"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)"># Used by Chat SDK to persist Slack thread conversation states (Primary DB)</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="10"><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">CHAT_STATE_DATABASE_URL</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">&quot;postgres://[user]:[password]@[neon_hostname]/[dbname]?sslmode=require&amp;channel_binding=require&quot;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="11"></span>
<span class="line" data-line="12"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)"># Used by the AI to safely run analytical queries (Read Replica)</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="13"><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">REPLICA_DATABASE_URL</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">&quot;postgres://[user]:[password]@[neon_read_replica_hostname]/[dbname]?sslmode=require&amp;channel_binding=require&quot;</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-4" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure><p>The two database URLs serve different purposes:</p><ul>
<li><code>CHAT_STATE_DATABASE_URL</code> is used for bot state persistence (read/write).</li>
<li><code>REPLICA_DATABASE_URL</code> is used by AI-generated SQL (read-only).</li>
</ul><p>Keeping them separate prevents analytics queries from touching your primary write path.</p></div></li><li class="numbered-step relative mt-8! mb-0! flex w-full items-start gap-4 pl-0! before:flex before:size-7 before:items-center before:justify-center before:rounded-full before:bg-gray-new-20 before:text-center before:font-mono before:text-sm before:leading-snug before:font-medium before:tracking-tight before:text-white before:content-[counter(section)] before:[counter-increment:section] after:absolute after:top-8 after:-bottom-7 after:left-[.8125rem] after:w-px after:bg-gray-new-90 first:mt-0! last:after:bottom-0 dark:before:bg-gray-new-90 dark:before:text-black-pure dark:after:bg-gray-new-30 [&amp;_h2]:text-2xl [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal!"><div class="w-[calc(100%-100px)] flex-1 [&amp;&gt;*_*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:pt-0 md:[&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0"><h2 id="create-the-ai-agent" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Create the AI agent</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#create-the-ai-agent" aria-label="Link to Create the AI agent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2><p>You will define two tools that the AI can call:</p><ol>
<li><code>query_database</code>: Executes SQL queries against the Neon read replica and returns results as JSON.</li>
<li><code>generate_chart</code>: Takes data and generates a chart image URL using the <a class="group inline" href="https://quickchart.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">QuickChart API<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a></li>
</ol><p>With these tools, the AI can autonomously run queries and generate visualizations based on user requests in Slack.</p><h3 id="create-the-database-query-helper-function" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Create the database query helper function</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#create-the-database-query-helper-function" aria-label="Link to Create the database query helper function"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3><p>You need a simple utility that the Vercel AI SDK can call to execute its generated SQL against the read replica.</p><p>Create <code>lib/db.ts</code>:</p><figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="typescript"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">import</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> { neon } </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">from</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;@neondatabase/serverless&#x27;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">export</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> const</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)"> runQueryOnReplica</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> =</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> async</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> (sql</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">:</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)"> string</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">) </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=&gt;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> {</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">    const</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)"> sqlClient</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> =</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)"> neon</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">(</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)">process</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">.</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)">env</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">.</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)">REPLICA_DATABASE_URL</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">!</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">);</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">    try</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> {</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">        const</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)"> result</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> =</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> await</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)"> sqlClient</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">.query</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">(sql);</span></span>
