<li><code>ToolLoopAgent</code> allows the model to call tools iteratively until it determines it has a final answer.</li>
<li><code>query_database</code> executes SQL against the read replica and returns results as JSON. If the query fails (for example, due to a syntax error), it returns the error message so the AI can attempt to self-correct.</li>
